{"id": "140357", "name": "מציאת חיתוך וחיבור תת-מרחבים ב R^4", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "randvervect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "randvervectnonzero", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "transpose(makelist(rand_with_prohib(-k,k,[0]),n))"}, {"name": "randhorvect", "params": ["n", "k"], "body": "matrix(makelist(rand_with_step(-k,k,1),n))"}, {"name": "dezero", "params": ["vec", "n", "k"], "body": "if (zeromatrixp(vec)) then randvervectnonzero(n,k) else vec"}, {"name": "dezerolst", "params": ["veclst", "k"], "body": "map(lambda([vec], dezero(vec, length(vec),k)), veclst)"}, {"name": "matrify", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([])], for i:1 thru length(veclst) do(mat:addcol(mat,veclst[i])),mat)"}, {"name": "collify", "params": ["M"], "body": "block([cols:[]],for i:1 thru length(transpose(M)) do(cols: endcons(col(M,i),cols)),cols)"}, {"name": "rowify", "params": ["M"], "body": "block([rows:[]],for i:1 thru length(M) do(rows: endcons(row(M,i),rows)),rows)"}, {"name": "inSpan", "params": ["veclst1", "veclst2"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst1)) = rank(matrify(append(veclst1,veclst2))))"}, {"name": "dependentvects", "params": ["veclst"], "body": "is(rank(matrify(veclst))<length(veclst))"}, {"name": "alltrue", "params": ["pred", "lst"], "body": "emptyp(delete(true,map(pred, lst)))"}, {"name": "colp", "params": ["v"], "body": "if (matrixp(v)) then is(length(v)=n and length(transpose(v))=1) else false"}, {"name": "collistp", "params": ["lst"], "body": "alltrue(colp,lst)"}, {"name": "base_for_intersection", "params": ["sp1", "sp2"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([]),d1:length(sp1), ans:[]],\nfor v in sp1 do mat:addcol(mat,v), for v in sp2 do mat:addcol(mat,v),\nnullB: nullspace(mat),\nfor v in nullB do ans:cons(sum(v[i][1]*sp1[i],i,1,d1),ans),ans)"}, {"name": "base_for_sum", "params": ["sp1", "sp2"], "body": "block([mat:matrix([]), ans:[]],\nfor v in sp1 do mat:addcol(mat,v), for v in sp2 do mat:addcol(mat,v),\nans:args(columnspace(mat)),ans)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}^4\\)</span> שני תת-מרחבים</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[U=\\text{span}\\left\\{{{CT:0}}\\right\\} \\quad W=\\text{span}\\left\\{{{CT:1}}\\right\\}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><p>מצאו <strong>בסיס</strong> למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span> שנסמנו ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(B\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(B= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-veclist\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: וקטורי עמודה בתוך סוגריים מרובעים, מופרדים בפסיקים. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">[matrix([1],[2],[0]), matrix([0],[1],[3])]</code>.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><p>מצאו <strong>בסיס</strong> למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U+W\\)</span> שנסמנו <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(C\\)</span>.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(C= \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\"><p>הערה: בתבנית התשובה מופיע וקטור אחד בכל בסיס. במידת הצורך הוסיפו/הורידו וקטורים מהבסיס.</p><p>אם אחד מהמרחבים הוא מרחב האפס, הזינו במקום המתאים את הרשימה הריקה:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\"><code dir=\"ltr\">[]</code></p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>\n<p>[[feedback:prt2]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 60, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[matrix([a],[b],[c],[d])]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 60, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[matrix([a],[b],[c],[d])]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "validInput: collistp(ans1);\n\nans: if validInput then ans1 else []; /*avoid errors due to invalid input*/\nindependent: not dependentvects(ans);\nsubspaceU: inSpan(spaces[1],ans);\nsubspaceW: inSpan(spaces[2],ans);\nspanning: is(subspaceU and subspaceW and rank(matrify(ans))=dimintersection);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "validInput", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> ברשימה שהזנת כבסיס למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span> קיימים איברים שאינם וקטורי עמודה מהגודל הנכון.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "independent", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span> תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "subspaceU", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> בין הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span> יש וקטורים שאינם שייכים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "subspaceW", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 4, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> בין הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span> יש וקטורים שאינם שייכים ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(W\\)</span>.</div>"}}, {"name": 4, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "spanning", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-5-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — נכון.</b> הזנת בסיס נכון למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-5-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף א׳ — שגוי.</b> הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span> אינם פורשים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U\\cap W\\)</span>.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "validInput: collistp(ans2);\n\n\nans: if validInput then ans2 else []; /*avoid errors due to invalid input*/\nindependent: not dependentvects(ans);\nsubspace: inSpan(append(spaces[1],spaces[2]),ans);\nspanning: is(subspace and rank(matrify(ans))=dimplus);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "validInput", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> ברשימה שהזנת כבסיס למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U+W\\)</span> קיימים איברים שאינם וקטורי עמודה מהגודל הנכון.</div>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "independent", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt2-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-2-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> הוקטורים שהזנת כבסיס למרחב <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(U+W\\)</span> תלויים לינארית.</div>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "subspace", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt2-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-3-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\"><b>סעיף ב׳ — שגוי.</b> בין הוקטורים שה